---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Go Cheat Sheet | Free Goroutines, Channels & Syntax Reference"
  description="Complete Go cheat sheet with goroutines, channels, structs, interfaces, and common patterns. Free reference for Go developers."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Go<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Goroutines, channels, structs, interfaces, and common patterns. From basics to advanced Go.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Variables & Types</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Basic Types</h3>
        <pre><code>x &#58;= 42              // int
y &#58;= 3.14            // float64
s &#58;= "hello"         // string
b &#58;= true            // bool
var z int = 10       // explicit</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Collections</h3>
        <pre><code>nums &#58;= []int&#123;1, 2, 3&#125;
m &#58;= map[string]int&#123;
    "one"&#58; 1, "two"&#58; 2,
&#125;
m["three"] = 3</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Control Flow</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Conditionals</h3>
        <pre><code>if x > 0 &#123;
    // positive
&#125; else if x == 0 &#123;
    // zero
&#125; else &#123;
    // negative
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Loops</h3>
        <pre><code>for i &#58;= 0; i < 10; i++ &#123;
    // C-style
&#125;

for _, v &#58;= range nums &#123;
    // range
&#125;

for x > 0 &#123;
    // while-style
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Functions</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Basic Function</h3>
        <pre><code>func add(a, b int) int &#123;
    return a + b
&#125;

func greet(name string) string &#123;
    return "Hello, " + name
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Multiple Returns</h3>
        <pre><code>func divide(a, b float64) (float64, error) &#123;
    if b == 0 &#123;
        return 0, errors.New("div by zero")
    &#125;
    return a / b, nil
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Structs & Interfaces</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Structs</h3>
        <pre><code>type User struct &#123;
    Name string
    Age  int
&#125;

u &#58;= User&#123;Name&#58; "Alice", Age&#58; 30&#125;
fmt.Println(u.Name)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Interfaces</h3>
        <pre><code>type Writer interface &#123;
    Write([]byte) (int, error)
&#125;

// Implicit implementation
// No "implements" keyword</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Concurrency</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Goroutines</h3>
        <pre><code>go func() &#123;
    fmt.Println("async")
&#125;()

// WaitGroup
var wg sync.WaitGroup
wg.Add(1)
go func() &#123;
    defer wg.Done()
    // work
&#125;()</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Channels</h3>
        <pre><code>ch &#58;= make(chan int)
ch <- 42          // send
val &#58;= <-ch       // receive

// Buffered
ch &#58;= make(chan int, 10)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
